--- body ---
## Context

Tracker 1382. Author's ruling 2026-10-31: the raw agent transcripts are data we
generate and several projects use (the harness, cadens), so they live under the
"our data" folder, beside the datasets: `datasets/ours/` (doudou already has
`~/data/datasets/{external,ours}`; padme has `/data/datasets/external/` only,
root-owned 755). Raw is not a dataset, but it belongs there.

Today two nightly timers store the same transcripts at 03:30:
`transcript-archive` (1383, `~/archive/transcripts/<host>/<runtime>/`, zstd,
Claude Code + Codex + Pi + seat spool, re-copy on growth, from 2026-06) and
cadens' `cadens-harvest` (`/data/projets/cadens/raw/claude-local/<host>/`,
14 GB plain, Claude Code only, `rsync --ignore-existing` so grown files stay
truncated, but holds 2026-02..05 already gone from the live trees). Consolidate
into one store; cadens' side is its own ticket in its repository.

Target layout:
- padme: `/data/datasets/ours/agent-sessions/raw/<host>/<runtime>/...` (and the
  spool beside it); the author creates `/data/datasets/ours` (root-owned parent)
- doudou: `~/data/datasets/ours/agent-sessions/raw/doudou/...`, pushed to padme
- one README in `agent-sessions/` (provenance, layout, runtimes, retention,
  privacy: GDPR-sensitive behavioural data of the author, private permissions,
  never leaves the hosts unencrypted; consumers: harness, cadens)

## Exit criteria

- [ ] The archive root is one setting (`transcript_spool.py`), default the
      target layout per host; `transcript_archive.py`, `trace_timeline.py` and the
      launch-line helper read it; tests updated
- [ ] Existing archives moved (not re-copied from live trees) to the new root on
      padme and doudou; counts and bytes before and after printed in the PR
- [ ] Backfill: every cadens raw file absent from the archive (by relative path)
      is added, compressed, for both hosts; a file present in both keeps the
      larger (non-truncated) version; counts printed
- [ ] doudou's push targets the new padme path and is prefixed `-` so an absent
      padme does not fail the archive run
- [ ] `agent-sessions/README.md` written; directories 700
- [ ] memo § 4.2 and INSTALL.md name the new location
